        <h1>Free Developer Tools That <em>Run in Your Browser</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Best Answer Hub gathers the everyday developer utilities, JSON formatter, JWT decoder, regex tester, hash generator, diff checker, and more, into one toolbox that runs client-side. No account, no ads, and the code and tokens you paste are processed on your own machine.</p>
